1. Notice Regarding Game Data and Protected Assets
--------------------------------------------------
This repository and any binary builds or packages distributed from it DO NOT
include ROMs, disc images (.bin, .cue, .chd, .iso), proprietary Sony BIOS dumps,
or code, art, audio, or assets from *Crash Bandicoot 2: Cortex Strikes Back*
(Sony Computer Entertainment / Naughty Dog).

To generate and run the port locally, each user must supply their own legitimate
copy of the disc (USA, SCUS-94154).


